  "bodyHash": "3d8501ec487b4f01",
  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。大量活躍於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Campfire Spawn and Tweaks 新增在營火內設定重生點的功能，並對該方塊的機制進行一些調整。預設情況下，重生時您將獲得 10 秒的火焰抗性，並位於營火頂部。此功能適用於主世界、地獄和終界，也支援模組添加的維度。<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"><br><br><span><strong>預設設定下的功能：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>營火初始狀態為未點燃。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>點燃營火會在其頂部建立重生點。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>使用沙子、泥土或靈魂沙右鍵點擊營火可將其熄滅。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>可使用打火石右鍵點擊淹水的營火以移除淹水狀態。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>點擊營火側面時，防止在相鄰方塊上放置火。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>若玩家於營火內重生，將獲得 10 秒的火焰保護。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>若重生時營火上方有方塊，將建立一個兩格高的空氣空間。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>蹲下並右鍵點擊床將覆蓋營火重生位置。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>◉&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>蹲下並右鍵點擊營火將移除重生位置。或在點燃時同樣操作以防止設定位置。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>campfiresStartUnlit</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，新放置的營火將處於未點燃狀態。<br><br><span><strong>sneakRightClickCampfireToUnset</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>蹲下並右鍵點擊營火會取消營火重生點。<br><br><span><strong>bedsOverrideCampfireSpawn</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，在床中睡覺將覆蓋營火重生點。<br><br><span><strong>createAirPocketIfBlocksAboveCampfire</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，若重生時營火上方有方塊阻擋，模組會將其破壞。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>sendMessageOnNewCampfireSpawnSet</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，每當設定新的營火重生點時，將向玩家發送訊息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnUnset</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，每當取消營火重生點時，將向玩家發送訊息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnMissing</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，每當重生時遺漏營火重生點，將向玩家發送訊息。<br><br><span><strong>sendMessageOnCampfireSpawnOverride</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，每當營火重生點被 PlayerSetSpawnEvent 覆蓋時，將向玩家發送訊息。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>fireResitanceDurationOnRespawnInMs</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 10000，最小值 0，最大值 3600000<br>玩家於營火重生時的火焰抗性持續時間（毫秒）。數值 0 會停用此功能，並將玩家放置在營火旁。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>放置並破壞營火，即可設定與取消重生點：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>在營火上方放置泥土以將其熄滅：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"552\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>於營火處重生：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>從地獄在地獄內重生：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"554\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>從主世界在地獄內重生：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br>使用打火石點燃營火以移除淹水狀態：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks/g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
